---
// The deepening sessions, presented the way the course sells: a library you
// step into the moment you join, and a live session every month through the
// end of 2026. The dated per-session schedule lives in the portal, not on
// this sales page.
---

<section class="cc-ceee">
  <div class="cc-ceee-inner">
    <div class="cc-ceee-head">
      <div class="cc-eyebrow cc-eyebrow--center">The deepening sessions</div>
      <h2 class="cc-h2" style="margin-top: var(--sp-4); max-width: 26ch; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        Where the work <em>keeps opening.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="cc-ceee-lead">
        Two-hour live gatherings where current students and alumni take the
        work wider with Jacob — into questions that don't fit a single class,
        experiences that need more space, the practice as it lives now.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cc-ceee-duo">
      <article class="cc-ceee-panel">
        <div class="ceee-tag">
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🎧</span>
          Instant access
        </div>
        <h3>A library of deepening sessions</h3>
        <p>
          Every session is recorded into the library — yours from the moment
          you join, to keep returning to at your own rhythm.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="cc-ceee-panel cc-ceee-panel--live">
        <div class="ceee-tag">
          <span class="ceee-live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Live · every month
        </div>
        <h3>A live session every month</h3>
        <p>
          Through the end of 2026, the circle keeps gathering live — once a
          month, with Jacob and the whole community in the room together.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
